<title>USA: U.S. 1996 corn in major states -USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. 1996 corn in major states -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA final 1996 corn production and yields in major states, and final revised 1995.</p>
<p>    -    PRODUCTION, 1,000 bushels:    YIELD, bushels/acre:</p>
<p>    -    1996----Prev.'96	1995     1996--Prev.  1995</p>
<p> IL  1,468,800  1,479,600  1,130,000   136.0  137.0  113.0</p>
<p> IN    670,350    675,800    598,900   123.0  124.0  113.0</p>
<p> IA  1,718,100  1,736,000  1,402,200   138.0  140.0  123.0</p>
<p> KS    357,200    364,250    244,280   152.0  155.0  124.0</p>
<p> MN    868,750    847,000    731,850   125.0  121.0  119.0</p>
